# ac-7rt scenario 3b: a missing hold task is recreated by the tick (bead AC "a 404 on refresh
# results in a new hold"). Nothing in dispatch.test.ts covers this; the PR argues it from
# `PUT /v1/tasks/:name` creating a missing task, so it is measured here.
# head a35fe78. trigger qa-ac7rt-sprite v3 (idle_timeout 7m, key qa-ac7rt-s3b). execution a12a214a.
# Hub B started 13:35:30.6, so its ticks fall at 13:40:32, 13:45:32, 13:50:32.
# The run was fired at 13:40:40, just after the 13:40:32 tick, so the tick under test is 13:45:32.

